ent-OrbitraRatvarEminenceInvitation = Eminence invitation
    .desc = A brass token flickering with a distant presence.
ent-OrbitraRatvarEminenceAvatar = Eminence
    .desc = A presence within the clockwork collective.
ent-OrbitraMindRoleRatvarEminence = Ratvar Eminence role
    .desc = { ent-BaseMindRoleAntag.desc }
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-name = Eminence
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-description = OOC: A cult observer. Select a living member to see through their body without controlling it. Recall allies to waygates and request events using shared cult energy.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-rules = Serve only the Ratvar cult that summoned you. Do not share information acquired while observing before taking the role. Do not waste shared energy to harm your cult.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-briefing = You are your cult's Eminence. Select a living member in Cult collective. Walls and darkness limit your view; you cannot control their body. Recall and reality controls are below the roster. Use +r text for cult communication. Use normal ghosting to leave.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-test-failed = Requires a living, controlled cult member on a map, outside containers, with test mode enabled. The Eminence slot may already be occupied or reserved by an invitation.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-test-created = Created the Eminence ghost role. Take it on a second client through the ghost-role menu and select a member to observe. Repeating the command does not create another slot.
ent-OrbitraActionRatvarEminenceMenu = cult collective
    .desc = Open the cult member selection menu.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-title = Eminence: cult collective
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-help = Select a living member to observe. Walls and darkness remain; body control is not transferred. Cult communication: +r text.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-search = Search members...
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-clear = Clear selection
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-unnamed = Unnamed
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-selected = Observing
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-ready = Available for selection
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-no-body = No available body
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-offline = Player is not controlling this body
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-container = Body is inside a container
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-not-alive = Requires a living member outside critical condition
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-blind = Member cannot see
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-outside = No available view on the cult's station
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-unavailable = This body is unavailable for observation
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-menu-empty = No matching entries. Change the search or wait for cult members.
ent-OrbitraRatvarEminenceSpire = eminence spire
    .desc = A brass beacon resonating with a distant collective presence.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-eminence = Eminence spire
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-eminence-desc = Creates an observer beacon. Interact empty-handed to propose a summon after 60 seconds. Another cult interaction cancels the proposal. One Eminence per cult.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-pending = A summon is pending. Interact empty-handed to cancel it.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-occupied = The Eminence slot is occupied or offered to ghosts.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-idle = Interact empty-handed to propose summoning an Eminence.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-denied = Requires an available, anchored beacon of your cult on the main station grid and a living, controlled member within reach.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-started = An Eminence summon was proposed. Any member can object by interacting with the spire within { $seconds } s.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-cancelled = A cult member cancelled the Eminence summon.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-summon-invited = Eminence is offered to ghosts for 30 seconds. If nobody accepts, the summon can be retried.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-status = Cult energy: { $energy }. Recall: { $cost }. Cooldown: { $seconds } s.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-help = Recall: the observed ally remains still for 7 seconds, then arrives at the selected waygate. Mass recall: once per cult, after 3 seconds, to a waygate within 5 tiles of the ark. Attached or unavailable bodies are skipped.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-ready = Ready
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-select = First observe an available member of your cult.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-cooldown = This ability is still cooling down.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-energy = Not enough shared cult energy.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-attached = The target must be on the main grid, outside containers, unbuckled and neither pulling nor being pulled.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-ability-destination = The waygate must belong to your cult, be powered, and have a clear floor on the main station grid.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-recall-button = Recall observed ally here
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-recall-warning = Eminence is recalling you to a waygate. Remain still for 7 seconds; movement or damage interrupts recall.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-recall-channeling = Recall is channeling. Repeated requests are unavailable.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-mass-button = Gather cult here (once)
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-mass-used = Mass recall was already used or is pending.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-mass-ark = Requires a waygate within 5 tiles of your cult's anchored ark.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-mass-warning = Eminence will gather available living members at the ark in { $seconds } s.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-no-destinations = Your cult has no waygates. Create and power a brass waygate.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-reality-status = Manipulate reality: { $cost } energy. Cooldown: { $seconds } s.
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-reality-anomaly = Create an anomaly
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-reality-grid = Initiate a power grid check
orbitra-ratvar-eminence-reality-station = The cult station is not eligible for native station events.
ent-OrbitraRatvarAnomalyEvent = anomaly event
    .desc = A disturbance in reality.
ent-OrbitraRatvarAnomalySpawner = anomaly spawner
    .desc = A disturbance in reality.
